  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7280401",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Asakura",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728040101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728040101": {
            "id": "728040101",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "You're here just in time. Today's an important day!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040102"
            ]
          },
          "728040102": {
            "id": "728040102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Is this about your weapon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040103"
            ]
          },
          "728040103": {
            "id": "728040103",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "That's right! I've been looking all over the place for clues, and I've finally determined the location of that band of Kairagi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040104"
            ]
          },
          "728040104": {
            "id": "728040104",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Today, I will redeem myself and take back my weapon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040105"
            ]
          },
          "728040105": {
            "id": "728040105",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh! Asakura is really motivated!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040106"
            ]
          },
          "728040106": {
            "id": "728040106",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "However, I mustn't make the same mistake as before. The Kairagi are numerous, and many of them are unscrupulous.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040107"
            ]
          },
          "728040107": {
            "id": "728040107",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "As long as they swarm me and drain my stamina, I'll be put on the back foot, and the same thing will happen again...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040108"
            ]
          },
          "728040108": {
            "id": "728040108",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Therefore, I want you to accompany me this time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040109"
            ]
          },
          "728040109": {
            "id": "728040109",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "I was defeated by them last time because the Kairagi were able to use their numerical advantage and took turns in whittling away my stamina.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040110"
            ]
          },
          "728040110": {
            "id": "728040110",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "After I ran out of energy, their leader challenged me to a duel.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040111"
            ]
          },
          "728040111": {
            "id": "728040111",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "This time, I would like you to fend off the surrounding Kairagi while I challenge their leader directly.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040112"
            ]
          },
          "728040112": {
            "id": "728040112",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "After I cut down that villain, I'll come and help you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040114",
              "728040116"
            ]
          },
          "728040114": {
            "id": "728040114",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "I am grateful for your assistance!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040119"
            ]
          },
          "728040119": {
            "id": "728040119",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "In short, I'll be leaving things to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040120"
            ]
          },
          "728040120": {
            "id": "728040120",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Now then, let us not delay things. Let's head off."
          },
          "728040116": {
            "id": "728040116",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Without their numbers, those Kairagi are nothing more than a rabble.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040117"
            ]
          },
          "728040117": {
            "id": "728040117",
            "speakerId": 12144,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "I have faith in your skills. Even if they decide to rush at you all at once, I still believe they'll stand no chance against you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040118"
            ]
          },
          "728040118": {
            "id": "728040118",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You think too highly of me..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280403",
      "subQuestName": "Defeat the Kairagi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728040301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728040301": {
            "id": "728040301",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "You? Hah, aren't you that brat from before? What, are you here to add something to my collection again?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040302"
            ]
          },
          "728040302": {
            "id": "728040302",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "No. I am here for my weapon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040303"
            ]
          },
          "728040303": {
            "id": "728040303",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "Heh, well, at least you've got some guts. But only one ally, really? You must really take me for a sucker, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040304"
            ]
          },
          "728040304": {
            "id": "728040304",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "But you know what? I'll give you a chance on account of your bravery, at least. Come on! Let's settle this somewhere else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040305"
            ]
          },
          "728040305": {
            "id": "728040305",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "Still... it wouldn't be good to leave my boys here with nothing to do, would it? I know! Why don't you ask your little helper to play with them a bit?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040308"
            ]
          },
          "728040308": {
            "id": "728040308",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "Hahaha. You've got some lip! Well then, boys, you heard 'em. Let 'em have it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040309"
            ]
          },
          "728040309": {
            "id": "728040309",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "As for you, let's go over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040310"
            ]
          },
          "728040310": {
            "id": "728040310",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "I leave this in your hands...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040311"
            ]
          },
          "728040311": {
            "id": "728040311",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'll take care of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040312"
            ]
          },
          "728040312": {
            "id": "728040312",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "You have my utmost thanks. I will slay him quickly and come to your aid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040313"
            ]
          },
          "728040313": {
            "id": "728040313",
            "speakerId": 20332,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\" Leader",
            "text": "Well, aren't you a talker yourself? You're welcome to try!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7280404",
      "subQuestName": "Interrogate the Kairagi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "728040206"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "728040206": {
            "id": "728040206",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "Agh! P—Please, spare me! Where did you get this kind of help...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040207"
            ]
          },
          "728040207": {
            "id": "728040207",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Foul villain! Hand my weapon over at once!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040208"
            ]
          },
          "728040208": {
            "id": "728040208",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "You... You're still all hung up about that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040209"
            ]
          },
          "728040209": {
            "id": "728040209",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "I am only here to retrieve my weapon. If you tell me where it is, I'll spare you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040210"
            ]
          },
          "728040210": {
            "id": "728040210",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "This...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040213"
            ]
          },
          "728040213": {
            "id": "728040213",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "N—No, please! Please stop! I—I didn't say I wouldn't say anything! We don't have to get this violent!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040214"
            ]
          },
          "728040214": {
            "id": "728040214",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "Th—That weapon was taken by our boss as part of his collection. If you want it, you can just go to the camp over there to get it from him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040215"
            ]
          },
          "728040215": {
            "id": "728040215",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Well, at least you have some sense.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040216"
            ]
          },
          "728040216": {
            "id": "728040216",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "P—Please, good sirs, I've told you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040217"
            ]
          },
          "728040217": {
            "id": "728040217",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Out of my sight!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040218"
            ]
          },
          "728040218": {
            "id": "728040218",
            "speakerId": 20331,
            "speakerName": "\"Kairagi\"",
            "text": "At once!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040219"
            ]
          },
          "728040219": {
            "id": "728040219",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "Not much martial skill to speak of, but he was quite the runner.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040220"
            ]
          },
          "728040220": {
            "id": "728040220",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Not to mention pretty quick to sell his buddies out, too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040221"
            ]
          },
          "728040221": {
            "id": "728040221",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "The Kairagi are ultimately a motley band who've banded together for their own selfish gain. Loyalty plays no part here, nor does conviction.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040222"
            ]
          },
          "728040222": {
            "id": "728040222",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "The moment trouble starts brewing on the horizon, they will pack up and leave. This is all too common.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040223"
            ]
          },
          "728040223": {
            "id": "728040223",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "But fortunately, I had you here to help me. I doubt that they would have capitulated so easily otherwise.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040224"
            ]
          },
          "728040224": {
            "id": "728040224",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "However, our next stop is their main encampment.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "728040225"
            ]
          },
          "728040225": {
            "id": "728040225",
            "speakerId": 3060,
            "speakerName": "Asakura",
            "text": "We will follow our original stratagem. I will take their leader on, and leave the small fry to you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
